WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:16.830
One afternoon Wukong and his companions were resting by a stream.

2
00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:20.192
They were eating peaches and berries.

3
00:00:20.212 --> 00:00:24.774
"We must be getting close to the Western Paradise," said the Tang Monk.

4
00:00:25.575 --> 00:00:26.896
"We've been traveling for years."

5
00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:32.083
"I feel like we've been traveling for of years," said Bajie.

6
00:00:33.604 --> 00:00:36.306
still have a long way to go," said Wukong.

7
00:00:36.326 --> 00:00:37.607
"But don't worry.

8
00:00:38.068 --> 00:00:42.091
Eventually we'll arrive in the Western Paradise and climb up the Spirit Mountain.

9
00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:46.894
Buddha's home, the Thunderclap Monastery, sits halfway up the mountain."

10
00:00:47.835 --> 00:00:50.117
The Tang Monk took a bite of his peach.

11
00:00:50.137 --> 00:00:54.140
"The Thunderclap Monastery must be wonderful to see."

12
00:00:56.072 --> 00:00:59.154
"The monastery is spectacular," said the monkey.

13
00:00:59.174 --> 00:01:01.695
"Golden light shines from it."

14
00:01:03.176 --> 00:01:04.156
Bajie moaned.

15
00:01:04.997 --> 00:01:08.939
"So we're going to have to climb a mountain at the end of this journey?

16
00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:11.841
Just thinking about that makes me tired."

17
00:01:13.502 --> 00:01:14.482
stroked his chin.

18
00:01:14.502 --> 00:01:17.564
"I really hope the journey ends soon."

19
00:01:18.744 --> 00:01:19.545
The pig nodded.

20
00:01:19.565 --> 00:01:21.426
"You're tired of traveling too?"

21
00:01:22.446 --> 00:01:25.108
"No," said Wujing with a serious look.

22
00:01:26.064 --> 00:01:28.265
"I'm just tired of hearing you complain."

23
00:01:30.205 --> 00:01:31.926
Everyone was quiet for a moment.

24
00:01:32.766 --> 00:01:39.248
Then Wujing's face broke into a smile, and everybody laughed, even Bajie.

25
00:01:40.088 --> 00:01:43.069
"Very funny, Wujing," said Bajie.

26
00:01:43.689 --> 00:01:44.909
The Tang Monk stood up.

27
00:01:45.389 --> 00:01:45.789
should go.

28
00:01:46.690 --> 00:01:49.330
I'd like to find a village or a monastery before dark."

29
00:01:51.551 --> 00:01:54.812
A couple of hours later, they were traveling up a mountain road.

30
00:01:55.832 --> 00:01:57.413
road curved around a bend.

31
00:02:01.255 --> 00:02:03.897
Ahead they could see a small monastery.

32
00:02:05.638 --> 00:02:06.899
Tang Monk gasped.

33
00:02:06.919 --> 00:02:09.080
"Is that the Thunderclap Monastery?"

34
00:02:10.561 --> 00:02:12.142
might be," said Bajie.

35
00:02:12.162 --> 00:02:14.303
"Golden light is shining from it."

36
00:02:15.704 --> 00:02:17.785
"It's on a mountain," Wujing added.

37
00:02:19.106 --> 00:02:24.044
laughed. "It's not the Thunderclap Monastery.

38
00:02:24.104 --> 00:02:26.085
We're not even in the Western Paradise yet."

39
00:02:27.245 --> 00:02:34.128
The monkey peered at the monastery for a moment and then frowned.

40
00:02:34.148 --> 00:02:39.390
"We must be careful—I see dark clouds over the monastery."

41
00:02:41.811 --> 00:02:44.032
The travelers continued walking along the road.

42
00:02:45.673 --> 00:02:47.854
Soon they were standing in front of the monastery.

43
00:02:49.174 --> 00:02:53.416
A sign over the door read: "Small Thunderclap Monastery."

44
00:02:55.461 --> 00:02:56.382
cried the Tang Monk.

45
00:02:57.483 --> 00:02:59.284
"This monastery must belong to Buddha!"

46
00:03:00.645 --> 00:03:01.806
Wukong shook his head.

47
00:03:02.327 --> 00:03:03.468
doesn't belong to Buddha.

48
00:03:04.088 --> 00:03:04.869
Let's keep walking."

49
00:03:07.992 --> 00:03:09.173
on," said Bajie.

50
00:03:09.193 --> 00:03:11.995
"Golden light is shining from this monastery.

51
00:03:12.856 --> 00:03:14.577
It must be an important place."

52
00:03:16.079 --> 00:03:17.840
"It's not," said Wukong.

53
00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:22.044
"We should really—" "We're going in," the Tang Monk said.

54
00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:24.601
is a Buddhist monastery.

55
00:03:25.082 --> 00:03:25.862
We should visit it."

56
00:03:28.545 --> 00:03:30.806
The monk opened the monastery's door and entered.

57
00:03:32.488 --> 00:03:33.589
and Wujing followed.

58
00:03:34.369 --> 00:03:36.711
Wukong sighed and went in after them.

59
00:03:41.535 --> 00:03:44.338
This place was definitely not what it seemed.

60
00:03:45.278 --> 00:03:47.520
The monkey pulled out his iron bar.

61
00:03:49.682 --> 00:03:51.984
The group entered the building's main hall.

62
00:03:53.436 --> 00:03:57.039
A large golden statue of Buddha sat before them.

63
00:03:57.059 --> 00:03:59.682
"Do you see that statue, Wukong?"

64
00:03:59.882 --> 00:04:00.763
said the Tang Monk.

65
00:04:02.024 --> 00:04:03.945
"This is a real Buddhist monastery."

66
00:04:05.587 --> 00:04:06.708
a voice boomed.

67
00:04:06.728 --> 00:04:11.011
"Who dares to enter without bowing to Buddha?"

68
00:04:12.493 --> 00:04:14.354
The Tang Monk trembled with fear.

69
00:04:15.335 --> 00:04:17.917
away, he fell to his knees and bowed.

70
00:04:19.118 --> 00:04:21.700
Bajie and Wujing bowed.

71
00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:24.781
continued to stand, peering at the statue.

72
00:04:25.721 --> 00:04:27.582
It looked very suspicious.

73
00:04:28.702 --> 00:04:30.122
"Why don't you bow?"

74
00:04:30.483 --> 00:04:31.283
the voice asked.

75
00:04:31.303 --> 00:04:34.704
"Wukong!" whispered the Tang Monk.

76
00:04:35.384 --> 00:04:36.444
"Show some respect!"

77
00:04:38.265 --> 00:04:39.385
won't bow to you!"

78
00:04:39.665 --> 00:04:40.625
shouted Wukong.

79
00:04:40.645 --> 00:04:49.148
"I can see that you're really Before the monkey could finish yelling, a large pair of cymbals fell

80
00:04:49.228 --> 00:04:49.748
from above.

81
00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:53.904
They slammed together, sealing Wukong inside.

82
00:04:53.924 --> 00:04:58.069
"Wukong!" cried the Tang Monk.

83
00:04:59.111 --> 00:05:03.717
Light flashed, and the statue turned into a demon with yellow eyebrows.

84
00:05:04.698 --> 00:05:07.021
demon stood up and smiled.

85
